@startuml
title L2-047 - Meet measurable browsing and API budgets
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Owner / release reviewer" as actor
box "Backend - Loupe Evaluation / Operations application" #D1FADF
participant "Documented release / restore runner" as page
participant "CapacityProfile" as entity
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Infrastructure and controlled runtime" #FFF4E5
participant "Production stores / workload adapters" as client
end box
note over page : Browser measurements use the production frontend in a controlled harness
actor -> page : Start workflow / review
page -> entity : Execute fixed warmup + measured workload [L2-047]
entity -> client : Collect HTTP, browser, semantic, and upload samples
client --> entity : Per-category percentiles and loss/error counts
entity --> page : Pass thresholds or recorded failures
page --> actor : measured budget report; not a sizing claim
@enduml
